# zsets2 — top N with ZRANGE ... REV WITHSCORES
#
# Learn: ZRANGE key start stop walks the set from the LOWEST score up.
# Add REV to walk from the highest (the older spelling is ZREVRANGE), and
# WITHSCORES to get each score right after its member.
#
# Task: print the top 3 players of lb:weekly, best first, with scores.
#

ZRANGE lb:weekly 0 2 WITHSCORES
